"Set :ref:`your availability <end-user-guide/preferences/set-your-status-"
"availability:set your availability>` using ``/away``, ``/offline``, "
"``/online``, or ``/dnd``"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/integrations-guide/built-in-slash-commands.rst:51
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Set :ref:`a custom status <end-user-guide/preferences/set-your-status-"
